    "description": "Telefunken is a contract rummy game popular in South America (Venezuela, Ecuador, Peru, Bolivia). 2â€“4 players, two 52-card decks plus four jokers (108 cards), 7 chips per player. First to empty hand by forming required melds across seven deals; lowest penalty wins. Melds: sets (3+ same rank), runs (3+ same suit). Each deal has a specific contract. Draw and discard; buy discards with chips before initial meld.",
